        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Instead, we outsource to contract manufacturing organizations (\"CMOs\"), for both drug substance and drug product production and have a successful cGMP-compliant manufacturing history of production of cGMP batches.",
